OL,3,GNEWSAFrom twig-like to wonky: the      
OL,4,AChristmas trees that sparked           
OL,5,Acontroversy                            
OL,7,FWhether it is on the wonk or just a    
OL,8,Flittle bit underwhelming, it would not 
OL,9,Fbe the festive season without a town   
OL,10,Fcentre's Christmas tree causing a      
OL,11,Flittle bit of controversy.             
OL,13,FThis year's opinion-splitting          
OL,14,Fcentrepiece comes courtesy of Ipswich, 
OL,15,Fin Suffolk, after the shape of it was  
OL,16,Flikened to a "giant sex toy",          
OL,17,Fespecially at night when it is lit up. 
OL,19,FTowering over shoppers on The Cornhill,
OL,20,Fit is the town's "most talked about    
OL,21,Ftree in years", according to Ipswich   
OL,22,FCentral boss, Lee Walker.              
